    "description": "10 -- EqualN: an N-bit equality comparator (requires N >= 2).\n\nXNOR each bit pair, then AND-reduce the per-bit results with a\nchained generator -- the standard reduction pattern.  `when` handles\nthe first link of the chain, the same boundary-folding idiom as\nadderN.",
